   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Laying the Foundations for Sustainable Investment Promotion through Improved utilization of Free Trade Agreements (FSIP)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Project Laying the Foundations for Sustainable Investment Promotion through Improved Utilization of Free Trade Agreements (FSIP), to be implemented through this Initiation Plan, is an initiatory phase designed set the basis for the Strategic Sustainable Investment Promotion (SSIP) Project which has been proposed for financing and aims to ensure Serbia&#x2019;s effective engagement in sustainable trade and investment under its newly signed Free Trade Agreements (with China, the UAE, and Egypt). Impl</narrative>
  </description>
